{"ID":"20240515131415-0z7uoj8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131415-0z7uoj8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131415-0z7uoj8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140440-l2u8flm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140440-l2u8flm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140440-l2u8flm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:589,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:589\u0026#125;","title":"057","type":"doc","updated":"20240515162110"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140440-l2u8flm","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 877px;","id":"20240515140440-l2u8flm","updated":"20240515162110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/8/13"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"KS"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"38歲，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/8/13"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"掉頭髮，黑斑，睡不好，咳嗽打噴嚏有尿液滲出，頭暈，便秘，乾眼，肚子大，頸部有突出物，經期來若走路較多，會酸痛影響睡眠，痔瘡。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 睡眠：每天到3:00都醒來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"開車或走路一小時會暈。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便：便秘三天一次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便淡黃，有時深黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排氣有。看電腦螢幕久會眼乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如喝多水或喝西瓜汁則手指腫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月經正常28天，每次約五天。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稍浮緩有力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 水停中焦。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝五錢　白朮四錢　茯苓五錢　豬苓三錢　澤瀉五錢　側柏葉五錢　當歸三錢　茜草五錢　川芎三錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白芍五錢　丹皮三錢　厚朴二錢　大黃三錢　枳實二錢　柴胡三錢　玉金三錢　酸棗仁三錢　半夏三錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"南星三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"200 克粉    三餐前三茶匙   先用粉，不行再用湯劑"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝五錢　白朮四錢　茯苓五錢　豬苓三錢　澤瀉五錢→五苓散，去中焦水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"側柏葉五錢　當歸三錢→生髮。　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茜草五錢　川芎三錢　丹皮三錢→去子宮瘀血治黑斑。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚朴二錢　大黃三錢　枳實二錢→小承氣湯治便秘。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢　玉金三錢　酸棗仁三錢→治肺先治肝。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏三錢　南星三錢→去肺中的津液。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女人臉上有黑斑，多為子宮有瘀血。將瘀血清出即可。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人陳述，一運動就頭暈，表示中病。病人應多運動。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"皮膚上的突出物為疣，可以電射移除，或是以燈心草燒掉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多吃甜食容易掉頭髮，師囑病人喝開水或是茶，不要吃甜食和其他飲料。病人的脈為浮表示有表症，又為弦表示有水，用五苓散。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}